//@version=6
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  TL PbD SHAPE PRO  v1.1 — hover manual: every label, rail, pill and panel row explains itself
//  1:1 rebuild of the "PbD Method" (Volume Profile Masterclass, Video 3:
//  P / b / D profile shapes) as a TradingView indicator in TraderLifestyle design.
//
//  Rules from the video (fully mechanical):
//   • Each day's volume profile prints a LETTER — the market's body language:
//       P  = fast impulse UP  + balance on TOP     -> buyers control  (bullish continuation)
//       b  = fast impulse DOWN + balance at BOTTOM -> sellers control (bearish continuation)
//       D  = wide symmetric bell curve, fat POC    -> everyone happy  (balance / range day)
//   • The thin tail = single prints ("nobody did business there") = the impulse.
//   • P behind you  -> Plan A: acceptance ABOVE balance -> buy dips, target new highs.
//                      Plan B: acceptance BELOW VAL (close broken, not wick! 2+ closes
//                      + volume) -> shape FAILS -> price does the FULL TRAVERSE back
//                      to the impulse origin. That short pays just as well.
//   • b behind you  -> exact mirror: sell rallies / failure = traverse UP to origin.
//   • D behind you  + today opens INSIDE the D -> range-bound playbook:
//                      FADE the edges: short VAH, long VAL, target POC / other side.
//                      The FIRST touch gives the best response.
//   • Golden rule: "Shape gives bias — NOT a guarantee. Always write BOTH plans."
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
indicator("TL PbD Shape Pro", "TL PbD Pro", overlay = true,
     max_boxes_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500)

// ─────────────────────────────── TL PALETTE ───────────────────────────────────
color COL_BG     = color.rgb(6, 17, 30)      // navy outer
color COL_PANEL  = color.rgb(10, 29, 46)     // panel glass
color COL_PANEL2 = color.rgb(15, 44, 66)     // panel section
color COL_BULL   = color.rgb(126, 224, 208)  // mint  -> P shape
color COL_BEAR   = color.rgb(244, 44, 58)    // TL red -> b shape
color COL_CYAN   = color.rgb(53, 200, 255)
color COL_GOLD   = color.rgb(255, 215, 40)   // gold  -> D shape / POC
color COL_GOLD2  = color.rgb(255, 236, 130)
color COL_GOLD3  = color.rgb(238, 190, 30)
color COL_GOLD4  = color.rgb(210, 160, 20)
color COL_GOLD5  = color.rgb(170, 125, 12)
color COL_GLINT  = color.rgb(255, 252, 214)
color COL_PINK   = color.rgb(255, 62, 130)
color COL_LIME   = color.rgb(214, 228, 78)
color COL_SELLBG = color.rgb(126, 32, 36)
color COL_BUYBG  = color.rgb(120, 154, 52)
color COL_TXT    = color.rgb(235, 235, 235)
color COL_GREY   = color.rgb(176, 182, 192)

// ─────────────────────────────── INPUTS ───────────────────────────────────────
grpP = "① Profile Engine (per day)"
nBins      = input.int(24, "Profile rows (price bins)", minval = 10, maxval = 40, group = grpP, tooltip = "How many horizontal volume rows each daily profile gets. The video reads shapes on standard exchange profiles — 24 rows reproduce that look. If the symbol has no volume, each bar counts as 1 (TPO-style).")
vaPct      = input.float(70, "Value area %", minval = 50, maxval = 90, step = 1, group = grpP, tooltip = "Video 2 of the masterclass: the value area holds ~70% of the day's volume. VAH/VAL are its edges, POC is the fattest row.")
profWidth  = input.float(0.35, "Profile width (fraction of day)", minval = 0.1, maxval = 0.8, step = 0.05, group = grpP, tooltip = "Visual width of the histogram relative to the day's bar count.")
showProf   = input.bool(true, "Draw daily profiles", group = grpP)
showVAbox  = input.bool(true, "Shade value area", group = grpP)
showLetter = input.bool(true, "Big P / b / D letter per day", group = grpP)

grpC = "② Shape Classification (the letters)"
pocUpper   = input.float(0.57, "P threshold: POC above this fraction of range", minval = 0.5, maxval = 0.8, step = 0.01, group = grpC, tooltip = "Video: P = impulse up, balance ON TOP. Mechanically: the POC sits in the upper part of the day's range. 0.57 = upper 43%.")
pocLower   = input.float(0.43, "b threshold: POC below this fraction of range", minval = 0.2, maxval = 0.5, step = 0.01, group = grpC, tooltip = "Video: b = impulse down, balance AT THE BOTTOM. POC in the lower part of the range. Everything between the two thresholds = D (balance).")

grpT = "③ Setups (the video playbook)"
showSignals = input.bool(true, "BUY/SELL signals active", group = grpT)
acceptBars  = input.int(2, "Acceptance = closes beyond level", minval = 1, maxval = 5, group = grpT, tooltip = "Video: 'wick is not enough — the LOW must break and the candle must CLOSE there'. 2+ closes beyond VAL/VAH = acceptance = shape failure -> full traverse.")
volMult     = input.float(1.2, "Failure needs volume spike (x avg)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.1, group = grpT, tooltip = "Video: 'and you see a small volume spike there — then we are headed to the origin'. Set 0 to disable the volume filter.")
maxFades    = input.int(2, "D-day: max fades per edge", minval = 1, maxval = 5, group = grpT, tooltip = "Video: 'the market gives you the wanted response only for a limited time — the FIRST response was perfect'. Limits how often each edge may be faded per day.")
useCont     = input.bool(true, "Setup: continuation (Plan A) — dips/rallies", group = grpT, tooltip = "P: dip into value that holds -> LONG (video confidence: 80%). b: rally into value that fails -> SHORT.")
useFail     = input.bool(true, "Setup: failure (Plan B) — full traverse", group = grpT, tooltip = "P/b: acceptance on the WRONG side of balance (2+ closes + volume) -> price walks the whole way back to the impulse origin (video confidence: 50%, 'pays just as much').")
useFade     = input.bool(true, "Setup: D-day edge fades", group = grpT, tooltip = "Previous day = D and today opens inside it: short VAH, long VAL, target POC / opposite edge. 'Play the whole inside game.'")

grpR = "④ Risk & Trade Management"
slBufAtr   = input.float(0.25, "SL buffer (ATR14 multiple)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.05, group = grpR, tooltip = "Stops sit beyond the structural level plus this ATR buffer — crypto/indices/FX all get a sane distance automatically.")
beAtTP1    = input.bool(true, "Move SL to break-even at TP1", group = grpR)
showTrade  = input.bool(true, "Draw entry/SL/TP lines", group = grpR)

grpD = "⑤ TL Design"
useTheme   = input.bool(true, "TL chart theme (navy + mint/red candles)", group = grpD)
showPanel  = input.bool(true, "Show TL panel", group = grpD)
panelPos   = input.string("Middle Left", "Panel position", options = ["Middle Left", "Top Left", "Bottom Left", "Top Right", "Middle Right", "Bottom Right"], group = grpD)
showLogo   = input.bool(true, "Animated 3D TL logo", group = grpD, tooltip = "Gold pixel monogram with depth shading. The light sweep animates on live ticks (market must be open — Pine only executes on ticks).")
showBias   = input.bool(true, "Bias note at day open", group = grpD, tooltip = "Prints the day plan on the chart: what the letter behind you means and which two plans you trade.")
showLegend = input.bool(true, "ⓘ HOW-TO-READ label on chart", group = grpD, tooltip = "A small ⓘ label at the right edge — hover it for the complete manual: what the histogram, letters, value area, rails, pills and lines mean.")
urlYT      = input.string("https://trader.lifestyle", "YouTube link (button tooltip)", group = grpD)
urlRF      = input.string("https://trader.lifestyle", "RoboForex link (button tooltip)", group = grpD)
urlWA      = input.string("https://trader.lifestyle", "WhatsApp link (button tooltip)", group = grpD)

grpA = "⑥ Alerts & Webhook (Automation)"
alSignals  = input.bool(true, "Alert on BUY/SELL (webhook JSON)", group = grpA, tooltip = "Create an alert with condition 'Any alert() function call' and paste your webhook URL into the alert. The message is ready-to-use JSON for bots/bridges.")
alManage   = input.bool(true, "Alert on TP / SL / BE", group = grpA)
alShape    = input.bool(false, "Alert when a day gets its letter (P/b/D)", group = grpA, tooltip = "Fires once at day close with the classified shape — lets your bot pick tomorrow's playbook automatically.")
whId       = input.string("TL-PBD-SHAPE-PRO", "Webhook strategy ID", group = grpA)

// ─────────────────────────────── BASICS ────────────────────────────────────────
float atr14   = ta.atr(14)
float volSma  = ta.sma(nz(volume, 0), 20)
bool  proc    = barstate.isconfirmed
float slBuffer = atr14 * slBufAtr

// Chart theme + navy future margin (paints the area right of the last candle)
bgcolor(useTheme ? color.new(COL_BG, 0) : na)
barcolor(useTheme ? (close >= open ? COL_BULL : COL_BEAR) : na)
var box marginBox = na
if useTheme and na(marginBox)
    marginBox := box.new(bar_index + 1, high * 1000, bar_index + 500, -high * 1000, border_color = color.new(COL_BG, 0), border_width = 1, bgcolor = color.new(COL_BG, 0))
if useTheme and not na(marginBox) and barstate.islast
    box.set_left(marginBox, bar_index + 1)
    box.set_right(marginBox, bar_index + 500)
    box.set_top(marginBox, high * 1000)
    box.set_bottom(marginBox, -high * 1000)

// intraday guard — daily profiles need intraday bars
bool intradayOK = timeframe.in_seconds() <= 3600 and not timeframe.isdwm
var label tfWarn = na
if not intradayOK and na(tfWarn) and barstate.islast
    tfWarn := label.new(bar_index, close, "TL PbD PRO\nUse an intraday timeframe (5m – 1h).\nDaily profiles are built from intraday bars.", style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), textcolor = COL_GOLD, size = size.normal)

// ─────────────────────────── DAY COLLECTOR ────────────────────────────────────
bool newDay = ta.change(time("D")) != 0

var array<float> cHi = array.new_float()
var array<float> cLo = array.new_float()
var array<float> cVo = array.new_float()
var int   dayStartIdx = na
var float dayHi = na
var float dayLo = na

// previous-day state (the playbook levels)
var string pdShape  = na
var float  pdVAH    = na
var float  pdVAL    = na
var float  pdPOC    = na
var float  pdHigh   = na
var float  pdLow    = na
var float  pdOrigin = na    // impulse origin: P -> day low, b -> day high
var int    pCnt = 0
var int    bCnt = 0
var int    dCnt = 0

// current-day setup state
var string openLoc   = "—"
var string biasTxt   = "—"
var int    aboveCnt  = 0
var int    belowCnt  = 0
var bool   contFired = false
var bool   failFired = false
var int    vahFades  = 0
var int    valFades  = 0
var bool   rangeDead = false

// live level lines for the running day
var line  lnVAH = na
var line  lnVAL = na
var line  lnPOC = na
var label lbVAH = na
var label lbVAL = na
var label lbPOC = na

// ──────────────── profile computation: bins, POC, value area ──────────────────
f_profile(array<float> aHi, array<float> aLo, array<float> aVo, int nB, float pLo, float pHi, float vaP) =>
    array<float> vols = array.new_float(nB, 0.0)
    float rng = pHi - pLo
    float binSz = rng / nB
    int n = array.size(aHi)
    if rng > 0 and n > 0
        for i = 0 to n - 1
            float h = array.get(aHi, i)
            float l = array.get(aLo, i)
            float v = array.get(aVo, i)
            if h <= l
                int idx0 = math.min(nB - 1, math.max(0, int(math.floor((h - pLo) / binSz))))
                array.set(vols, idx0, array.get(vols, idx0) + v)
            else
                for j = 0 to nB - 1
                    float bBot = pLo + j * binSz
                    float bTop = bBot + binSz
                    float ov = math.min(h, bTop) - math.max(l, bBot)
                    if ov > 0
                        array.set(vols, j, array.get(vols, j) + v * ov / (h - l))
    float total = 0.0
    int pocIdx = 0
    float pocV = -1.0
    for i = 0 to nB - 1
        float vv = array.get(vols, i)
        total += vv
        if vv > pocV
            pocV := vv
            pocIdx := i
    // 70% value-area expansion around the POC
    float vaVol = pocV
    int up = pocIdx + 1
    int dn = pocIdx - 1
    while vaVol < total * vaP / 100 and (up < nB or dn >= 0)
        float vUp = up < nB ? array.get(vols, up) : -1.0
        float vDn = dn >= 0 ? array.get(vols, dn) : -1.0
        if vUp >= vDn
            vaVol += vUp
            up += 1
        else
            vaVol += vDn
            dn -= 1
    [vols, pocIdx, dn + 1, up - 1, total]

f_shapeColor(string s) =>
    s == "P" ? COL_BULL : s == "b" ? COL_BEAR : COL_GOLD

f_shapeTip(string s) =>
    s == "P" ?
         "P-SHAPE — bullish continuation\n" +
         "Fast impulse UP, then balance ON TOP.\n" +
         "Thin tail below = single prints — nobody did business there.\n" +
         "Buyers feel like winners -> dips are for buying.\n" +
         "─────────────────\n" +
         "PLAN A (80%): acceptance ABOVE balance -> buy dips, target new highs.\n" +
         "PLAN B (50%): 2+ CLOSES below VAL + volume -> shape FAILS ->\n" +
         "full traverse back to the impulse origin (day low)." :
     s == "b" ?
         "b-SHAPE — bearish continuation\n" +
         "Fast impulse DOWN, then balance AT THE BOTTOM.\n" +
         "Thin tail above = the drop's single prints.\n" +
         "Sellers feel like winners -> rallies are for selling.\n" +
         "─────────────────\n" +
         "PLAN A (80%): acceptance BELOW balance -> sell rallies, target new lows.\n" +
         "PLAN B (50%): 2+ CLOSES above VAH + volume -> shape FAILS ->\n" +
         "full traverse back to the impulse origin (day high)." :
         "D-SHAPE — balance day\n" +
         "Symmetric bell curve, fat POC in the middle.\n" +
         "Buyers AND sellers are happy — fair price found.\n" +
         "─────────────────\n" +
         "Next day opens INSIDE the D -> range-bound playbook:\n" +
         "FADE the edges — short VAH, long VAL, target POC / other side.\n" +
         "The FIRST touch gives the best response.\n" +
         "Options: short straddle/strangle. Futures: play edge to edge."

// ─────────────────────── DAY CLOSE: build profile + letter ────────────────────
if newDay and array.size(cHi) > 0 and intradayOK
    int dayEndIdx = bar_index - 1
    int dayLen = math.max(1, dayEndIdx - dayStartIdx + 1)
    float rng = dayHi - dayLo
    if rng > 0
        [vols, pocIdx, vaLoIdx, vaHiIdx, total] = f_profile(cHi, cLo, cVo, nBins, dayLo, dayHi, vaPct)
        float binSz = rng / nBins
        float pocPx = dayLo + (pocIdx + 0.5) * binSz
        float vahPx = dayLo + (vaHiIdx + 1) * binSz
        float valPx = dayLo + vaLoIdx * binSz
        float pocPos = (pocPx - dayLo) / rng
        string shp = pocPos >= pocUpper ? "P" : pocPos <= pocLower ? "b" : "D"
        color shCol = f_shapeColor(shp)
        if shp == "P"
            pCnt += 1
        else if shp == "b"
            bCnt += 1
        else
            dCnt += 1
        // ── histogram ──
        if showProf
            float maxV = 0.0
            for i = 0 to nBins - 1
                maxV := math.max(maxV, array.get(vols, i))
            int maxLen = math.max(3, math.round(dayLen * profWidth))
            if maxV > 0
                for i = 0 to nBins - 1
                    float v = array.get(vols, i) / maxV
                    if v > 0.02
                        int lenB = math.max(1, math.round(v * maxLen))
                        float bBot = dayLo + i * binSz
                        color rowCol = i == pocIdx ? COL_GOLD : shCol
                        int alpha = i == pocIdx ? 12 : int(30 + (1 - v) * 45)
                        box.new(dayStartIdx, bBot + binSz, dayStartIdx + lenB, bBot, border_color = color.new(rowCol, 60), border_width = 1, bgcolor = color.new(rowCol, alpha))
        // ── value area + POC ──
        if showVAbox
            box.new(dayStartIdx, vahPx, dayEndIdx, valPx, border_color = color.new(shCol, 35), border_width = 1, border_style = line.style_dotted, bgcolor = color.new(shCol, 90), text = "VALUE AREA " + str.tostring(vaPct, "#") + "%", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = color.new(shCol, 55), text_halign = text.align_right, text_valign = text.align_bottom)
        line.new(dayStartIdx, pocPx, dayEndIdx, pocPx, color = color.new(COL_GOLD, 15), width = 2)
        label.new(dayStartIdx, pocPx, "POC", style = label.style_label_right, color = color.new(COL_PANEL, 40), textcolor = color.new(COL_GOLD, 20), size = size.tiny, tooltip = "POINT OF CONTROL — the fattest volume row of this day.\nThe price where most business was done = the fair-price magnet.\nDips towards a POC that HOLD are the highest-quality entries.")
        // ── the big letter ──
        if showLetter
            label.new(dayStartIdx + dayLen / 2, dayHi + rng * 0.10, shp, style = label.style_none, textcolor = shCol, size = size.huge, tooltip = f_shapeTip(shp))
        // ── store playbook for the new day ──
        pdShape  := shp
        pdVAH    := vahPx
        pdVAL    := valPx
        pdPOC    := pocPx
        pdHigh   := dayHi
        pdLow    := dayLo
        pdOrigin := shp == "P" ? dayLo : shp == "b" ? dayHi : na
        // shape alert (bot playbook selection)
        if alShape
            alert('{"id":"' + whId + '","symbol":"' + syminfo.ticker + '","action":"SHAPE","shape":"' + shp + '","vah":' + str.tostring(vahPx, format.mintick) + ',"val":' + str.tostring(valPx, format.mintick) + ',"poc":' + str.tostring(pocPx, format.mintick) + ',"tf":"' + timeframe.period + '"}', alert.freq_once_per_bar)
    // reset collector
    array.clear(cHi)
    array.clear(cLo)
    array.clear(cVo)

// ───────────────────────── NEW DAY: arm the playbook ──────────────────────────
if newDay
    dayStartIdx := bar_index
    dayHi := high
    dayLo := low
    aboveCnt := 0
    belowCnt := 0
    contFired := false
    failFired := false
    vahFades := 0
    valFades := 0
    rangeDead := false
    if not na(pdShape) and intradayOK
        openLoc := open > pdVAH ? "ABOVE" : open < pdVAL ? "BELOW" : "INSIDE"
        biasTxt := pdShape == "P" ? (openLoc == "BELOW" ? "CAUTION (open below P value)" : "LONG DIPS (buyers control)") :
                   pdShape == "b" ? (openLoc == "ABOVE" ? "CAUTION (open above b value)" : "SHORT RALLIES (sellers control)") :
                   openLoc == "INSIDE" ? "FADE THE EDGES (range day)" : "WAIT (open outside the D)"
        // live level rails for the running day
        color rail = f_shapeColor(pdShape)
        lnVAH := line.new(bar_index, pdVAH, bar_index + 1, pdVAH, color = color.new(rail, 25), style = line.style_dashed, width = 1)
        lnVAL := line.new(bar_index, pdVAL, bar_index + 1, pdVAL, color = color.new(rail, 25), style = line.style_dashed, width = 1)
        lnPOC := line.new(bar_index, pdPOC, bar_index + 1, pdPOC, color = color.new(COL_GOLD, 20), style = line.style_dotted, width = 1)
        lbVAH := label.new(bar_index + 1, pdVAH, "PD VAH", style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(COL_PANEL, 20), textcolor = rail, size = size.tiny, tooltip = "Previous day's Value Area High.\nP-day: dips into here are Plan-A buy territory.\nb-day: 2+ closes above = failure -> traverse to origin.\nD-day: fade shorts trigger here.")
        lbVAL := label.new(bar_index + 1, pdVAL, "PD VAL", style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(COL_PANEL, 20), textcolor = rail, size = size.tiny, tooltip = "Previous day's Value Area Low.\nP-day: 2+ closes below = failure -> traverse to origin.\nD-day: fade longs trigger here.")
        lbPOC := label.new(bar_index + 1, pdPOC, "PD POC", style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(COL_PANEL, 20), textcolor = COL_GOLD, size = size.tiny, tooltip = "Previous day's Point of Control — the fattest row, the magnet.\nDips towards the POC that HOLD are the highest-quality continuation entries.")
        if showBias
            label.new(bar_index, pdShape == "b" ? pdLow : pdHigh, pdShape + " BEHIND -> " + biasTxt, style = pdShape == "b" ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down, color = color.new(COL_PANEL, 15), textcolor = rail, size = size.small, tooltip = f_shapeTip(pdShape) + "\n─────────────────\nToday's open: " + openLoc + " the previous value area.")
else
    dayHi := math.max(nz(dayHi, high), high)
    dayLo := math.min(nz(dayLo, low), low)

// collect this bar into the running day
if intradayOK
    if na(dayStartIdx)
        dayStartIdx := bar_index
    array.push(cHi, high)
    array.push(cLo, low)
    array.push(cVo, nz(volume, 0) <= 0 ? 1.0 : volume)

// extend the live rails
if not na(lnVAH) and not newDay
    line.set_x2(lnVAH, bar_index)
    line.set_x2(lnVAL, bar_index)
    line.set_x2(lnPOC, bar_index)
    label.set_x(lbVAH, bar_index)
    label.set_x(lbVAL, bar_index)
    label.set_x(lbPOC, bar_index)

// ─────────────────────────── SIGNAL ENGINE ────────────────────────────────────
var int    tradeDir = 0
var float  tEntry   = na
var float  tSL      = na
var float  tTP1     = na
var float  tTP2     = na
var bool   tp1Done  = false
var string tSetup   = "—"
var string sigTxt   = "FLAT"

bool buySignal  = false
bool sellSignal = false
bool tp1Event   = false
bool tp2Event   = false
bool slEvent    = false
bool beEvent    = false

bool volSpike = volMult <= 0 or nz(volume, 0) > volSma * volMult or nz(volume[1], 0) > volSma[1] * volMult

f_tradeLines(float e, float s, float t1, float t2) =>
    line.new(bar_index, e, bar_index + 25, e, color = COL_GOLD, style = line.style_dashed, width = 1)
    line.new(bar_index, s, bar_index + 25, s, color = COL_PINK, style = line.style_dashed, width = 1)
    line.new(bar_index, t1, bar_index + 25, t1, color = COL_BULL, style = line.style_dashed, width = 1)
    line.new(bar_index, t2, bar_index + 25, t2, color = COL_CYAN, style = line.style_dashed, width = 1)
    label.new(bar_index + 25, e, "ENTRY", style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(COL_PANEL, 20), textcolor = COL_GOLD, size = size.tiny, tooltip = "ENTRY — close of the signal candle.\nThe pill on the signal bar explains WHY this trade was taken (hover it).")
    label.new(bar_index + 25, s, "SL", style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(COL_PANEL, 20), textcolor = COL_PINK, size = size.tiny, tooltip = "STOP LOSS — parked beyond the structural level\n(dip low / VAL / VAH / POC) plus an ATR buffer.\nMoves to break-even once TP1 is hit.")
    label.new(bar_index + 25, t1, "TP1", style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(COL_PANEL, 20), textcolor = COL_BULL, size = size.tiny, tooltip = "TARGET 1 — the first magnet:\nPOC on fade trades, previous day's extreme on continuation.\nHere the stop jumps to break-even and the runner stays in.")
    label.new(bar_index + 25, t2, "TP2", style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(COL_PANEL, 20), textcolor = COL_CYAN, size = size.tiny, tooltip = "TARGET 2 — the full playbook move:\nmeasured balance projection, opposite value edge,\nor the IMPULSE ORIGIN on failure traverses.")

// draws the signal pill + trade lines (no global mutation — Pine forbids it in functions)
f_pill(int dirI, string setup, float e, float s, float t1, float t2, string why) =>
    string body = dirI == 1 ? "  BUY ▲  \n" + setup : "  SELL ▼  \n" + setup
    string tip = why + "\n─────────────────\nEntry " + str.tostring(e, format.mintick) + "\nSL " + str.tostring(s, format.mintick) + "\nTP1 " + str.tostring(t1, format.mintick) + "\nTP2 " + str.tostring(t2, format.mintick)
    label.new(bar_index, dirI == 1 ? low : high, body, style = dirI == 1 ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down, color = dirI == 1 ? COL_BUYBG : COL_SELLBG, textcolor = COL_TXT, size = size.normal, tooltip = tip)
    if showTrade
        f_tradeLines(e, s, t1, t2)

if proc and intradayOK and not na(pdShape)
    // acceptance counters vs previous value area
    aboveCnt := close > pdVAH ? aboveCnt + 1 : 0
    belowCnt := close < pdVAL ? belowCnt + 1 : 0

    if showSignals and tradeDir == 0
        // ══ P-SHAPE PLAYBOOK ══
        if pdShape == "P"
            // Plan A — continuation: dip into value that HOLDS, then reclaim
            bool dipBar = low[1] <= pdVAH and close[1] >= pdVAL
            bool holdBar = low >= low[1] and close > open and close >= pdPOC
            if useCont and not contFired and openLoc != "BELOW" and dipBar and holdBar
                contFired := true
                buySignal := true
                tradeDir := 1
                tEntry := close
                tSL := math.min(low[1], pdVAL) - slBuffer
                tTP1 := pdHigh
                tTP2 := pdHigh + (pdVAH - pdVAL)
                tp1Done := false
                tSetup := "P-CONT · DIP HELD"
                sigTxt := "BUY " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " · " + tSetup
                f_pill(1, tSetup, tEntry, tSL, tTP1, tTP2,
                     "WHY THIS BUY? (video Plan A, ~80%)\n1) Yesterday = P-shape -> buyers control\n2) Open " + openLoc + " the value area\n3) Dip into value HELD (low not broken)\n4) Reclaim candle closed back at/above POC\nTarget: previous high, then measured balance move")
            // Plan B — failure: acceptance below VAL -> full traverse to origin
            if useFail and not failFired and belowCnt >= acceptBars and volSpike
                failFired := true
                sellSignal := true
                tradeDir := -1
                tEntry := close
                tSL := pdPOC + slBuffer
                tTP1 := pdVAL - (pdVAH - pdVAL)
                tTP2 := pdOrigin
                tp1Done := false
                tSetup := "P-FAIL · FULL TRAVERSE"
                sigTxt := "SELL " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " · " + tSetup
                f_pill(-1, tSetup, tEntry, tSL, tTP1, tTP2,
                     "WHY THIS SELL? (video Plan B, ~50%)\n1) Yesterday = P-shape, but...\n2) " + str.tostring(acceptBars) + "+ CLOSES below VAL = acceptance below balance\n3) Volume spike confirms sellers\n4) Rule: failed shape -> price walks the WHOLE way\n   back to the impulse origin (yesterday's low)")
        // ══ b-SHAPE PLAYBOOK ══
        if pdShape == "b"
            bool rallyBar = high[1] >= pdVAL and close[1] <= pdVAH
            bool rejBar = high <= high[1] and close < open and close <= pdPOC
            if useCont and not contFired and openLoc != "ABOVE" and rallyBar and rejBar
                contFired := true
                sellSignal := true
                tradeDir := -1
                tEntry := close
                tSL := math.max(high[1], pdVAH) + slBuffer
                tTP1 := pdLow
                tTP2 := pdLow - (pdVAH - pdVAL)
                tp1Done := false
                tSetup := "b-CONT · RALLY SOLD"
                sigTxt := "SELL " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " · " + tSetup
                f_pill(-1, tSetup, tEntry, tSL, tTP1, tTP2,
                     "WHY THIS SELL? (video Plan A, ~80%)\n1) Yesterday = b-shape -> sellers control\n2) Open " + openLoc + " the value area\n3) Rally into value FAILED (high not broken)\n4) Rejection candle closed back at/below POC\nTarget: previous low, then measured balance move")
            if useFail and not failFired and aboveCnt >= acceptBars and volSpike
                failFired := true
                buySignal := true
                tradeDir := 1
                tEntry := close
                tSL := pdPOC - slBuffer
                tTP1 := pdVAH + (pdVAH - pdVAL)
                tTP2 := pdOrigin
                tp1Done := false
                tSetup := "b-FAIL · FULL TRAVERSE"
                sigTxt := "BUY " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " · " + tSetup
                f_pill(1, tSetup, tEntry, tSL, tTP1, tTP2,
                     "WHY THIS BUY? (video Plan B, ~50%)\n1) Yesterday = b-shape, but...\n2) " + str.tostring(acceptBars) + "+ CLOSES above VAH = acceptance above balance\n3) Volume spike confirms buyers\n4) Rule: failed shape -> full traverse back to the\n   impulse origin (yesterday's high)")
        // ══ D-SHAPE PLAYBOOK (range day) ══
        if pdShape == "D" and openLoc == "INSIDE" and not rangeDead
            if useFade and vahFades < maxFades and high >= pdVAH and close < pdVAH
                vahFades += 1
                sellSignal := true
                tradeDir := -1
                tEntry := close
                tSL := pdVAH + math.max(slBuffer, (pdVAH - pdVAL) * 0.25)
                tTP1 := pdPOC
                tTP2 := pdVAL
                tp1Done := false
                tSetup := "D-FADE · VAH REJECT"
                sigTxt := "SELL " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " · " + tSetup
                f_pill(-1, tSetup, tEntry, tSL, tTP1, tTP2,
                     "WHY THIS SELL? (video D-day playbook)\n1) Yesterday = D-shape (balance, fair price)\n2) Today opened INSIDE the D -> range rules\n3) Price tagged the value area HIGH and rejected\n4) Fade the edge: target POC, runner to VAL\nTouch #" + str.tostring(vahFades) + " — the FIRST response is the best")
            else if useFade and valFades < maxFades and low <= pdVAL and close > pdVAL
                valFades += 1
                buySignal := true
                tradeDir := 1
                tEntry := close
                tSL := pdVAL - math.max(slBuffer, (pdVAH - pdVAL) * 0.25)
                tTP1 := pdPOC
                tTP2 := pdVAH
                tp1Done := false
                tSetup := "D-FADE · VAL REJECT"
                sigTxt := "BUY " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + " · " + tSetup
                f_pill(1, tSetup, tEntry, tSL, tTP1, tTP2,
                     "WHY THIS BUY? (video D-day playbook)\n1) Yesterday = D-shape (balance, fair price)\n2) Today opened INSIDE the D -> range rules\n3) Price tagged the value area LOW and rejected\n4) Fade the edge: target POC, runner to VAH\nTouch #" + str.tostring(valFades) + " — the FIRST response is the best")
        // range day dies once one side gets accepted
        if pdShape == "D" and (aboveCnt >= acceptBars or belowCnt >= acceptBars)
            rangeDead := true

    // ── trade management: TP1 -> BE, TP2 / SL exits ──
    if tradeDir == 1
        if not tp1Done and high >= tTP1
            tp1Done := true
            tp1Event := true
            if beAtTP1
                tSL := tEntry
                beEvent := true
            label.new(bar_index, high, " TP1 ✔ ", style = label.style_label_down, color = color.new(COL_BULL, 15), textcolor = COL_BG, size = size.small, tooltip = "TP1 hit — first target (POC / previous high).\nStop moved to break-even, runner targets TP2.")
        if high >= tTP2
            tp2Event := true
            tradeDir := 0
            sigTxt := "TP2 HIT ✔ · " + tSetup
            label.new(bar_index, high, " TP2 ✔ ", style = label.style_label_down, color = color.new(COL_BULL, 0), textcolor = COL_BG, size = size.small, tooltip = "TARGET 2 REACHED — the full playbook move is complete.\nSetup: " + tSetup + "\nThe engine goes flat and scans for the next setup.")
        else if low <= tSL
            slEvent := true
            tradeDir := 0
            sigTxt := tp1Done ? "BE EXIT · " + tSetup : "SL HIT ✖ · " + tSetup
            label.new(bar_index, low, tp1Done ? " BE " : " SL ✖ ", style = label.style_label_up, color = color.new(tp1Done ? COL_CYAN : COL_BEAR, 15), textcolor = tp1Done ? COL_BG : COL_TXT, size = size.small, tooltip = tp1Done ? "BREAK-EVEN EXIT — TP1 already paid, the runner\ncame back to entry. A risk-free trade." : "STOP HIT — this plan is invalidated.\nRemember the golden rule: when a shape FAILS,\nthe OTHER plan (full traverse) is usually the trade.")
    else if tradeDir == -1
        if not tp1Done and low <= tTP1
            tp1Done := true
            tp1Event := true
            if beAtTP1
                tSL := tEntry
                beEvent := true
            label.new(bar_index, low, " TP1 ✔ ", style = label.style_label_up, color = color.new(COL_BULL, 15), textcolor = COL_BG, size = size.small, tooltip = "TP1 hit — first target (POC / previous low).\nStop moved to break-even, runner targets TP2.")
        if low <= tTP2
            tp2Event := true
            tradeDir := 0
            sigTxt := "TP2 HIT ✔ · " + tSetup
            label.new(bar_index, low, " TP2 ✔ ", style = label.style_label_up, color = color.new(COL_BULL, 0), textcolor = COL_BG, size = size.small, tooltip = "TARGET 2 REACHED — the full playbook move is complete.\nSetup: " + tSetup + "\nThe engine goes flat and scans for the next setup.")
        else if high >= tSL
            slEvent := true
            tradeDir := 0
            sigTxt := tp1Done ? "BE EXIT · " + tSetup : "SL HIT ✖ · " + tSetup
            label.new(bar_index, high, tp1Done ? " BE " : " SL ✖ ", style = label.style_label_down, color = color.new(tp1Done ? COL_CYAN : COL_BEAR, 15), textcolor = tp1Done ? COL_BG : COL_TXT, size = size.small, tooltip = tp1Done ? "BREAK-EVEN EXIT — TP1 already paid, the runner\ncame back to entry. A risk-free trade." : "STOP HIT — this plan is invalidated.\nRemember the golden rule: when a shape FAILS,\nthe OTHER plan (full traverse) is usually the trade.")

// big MT5-style arrows on signal bars
plotshape(sellSignal, "SELL arrow", shape.triangledown, location.abovebar, COL_BEAR, size = size.small, display = display.pane)
plotshape(buySignal, "BUY arrow", shape.triangleup, location.belowbar, COL_BULL, size = size.small, display = display.pane)

// ─────────────── ⓘ HOW-TO-READ label (the on-chart manual) ────────────────────
var label legendLab = na
if showLegend and barstate.islast
    string manual = "HOW TO READ TL PbD SHAPE PRO\n" +
         "─────────────────────────────\n" +
         "HISTOGRAM  = that day's volume profile: each row shows how much\n" +
         "business was done at that price. Long row = lots of trading.\n" +
         "COLOR = the day's letter:  P mint (buyers)  ·  b red (sellers)  ·  D gold (balance).\n" +
         "BIG LETTER above the day = the classified shape. Hover it for the full lesson.\n" +
         "DOTTED BOX = VALUE AREA (fattest " + str.tostring(vaPct, "#") + "% of volume). GOLD LINE + POC tag = point of control.\n" +
         "DASHED RAILS (PD VAH / PD POC / PD VAL) = yesterday's levels running through today —\n" +
         "these are the trigger lines for every setup. Hover each tag for its rule.\n" +
         "BIAS NOTE at day open = today's plan (letter behind you + open location).\n" +
         "─────────────────────────────\n" +
         "PILLS: BUY ▲ / SELL ▼ with the setup name. Hover a pill for the WHY:\n" +
         "the numbered reasons + Entry/SL/TP1/TP2 prices.\n" +
         "LINES: gold ENTRY · pink SL · mint TP1 (then break-even) · cyan TP2 (runner).\n" +
         "EXITS: TP1 ✔ / TP2 ✔ / SL ✖ / BE — hover them too.\n" +
         "─────────────────────────────\n" +
         "THE PLAYBOOK:\n" +
         "P behind you  -> buy dips that hold (Plan A) · 2+ closes below VAL + volume = FAIL -> short to origin (Plan B)\n" +
         "b behind you  -> sell rallies that fail (Plan A) · 2+ closes above VAH + volume = FAIL -> long to origin (Plan B)\n" +
         "D behind you  -> open inside the D: fade VAH/VAL to POC. First touch = best touch.\n" +
         "─────────────────────────────\n" +
         "Panel rows, inputs and every label on this chart have hover explanations."
    if na(legendLab)
        legendLab := label.new(bar_index + 26, high, "ⓘ  HOW TO READ", style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), textcolor = COL_CYAN, size = size.small, tooltip = manual)
    else
        label.set_xy(legendLab, bar_index + 26, high)
        label.set_tooltip(legendLab, manual)

// ─────────────────────────── ALERTS / WEBHOOK ─────────────────────────────────
f_json(string action) =>
    '{"id":"' + whId + '","symbol":"' + syminfo.ticker + '","action":"' + action + '","setup":"' + tSetup + '","shape":"' + (na(pdShape) ? "-" : pdShape) + '","price":' + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + ',"entry":' + str.tostring(na(tEntry) ? close : tEntry, format.mintick) + ',"sl":' + str.tostring(na(tSL) ? close : tSL, format.mintick) + ',"tp1":' + str.tostring(na(tTP1) ? close : tTP1, format.mintick) + ',"tp2":' + str.tostring(na(tTP2) ? close : tTP2, format.mintick) + ',"tf":"' + timeframe.period + '","time":"' + str.format_time(time, "yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm", "GMT") + '"}'

if alSignals and buySignal
    alert(f_json("BUY"), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if alSignals and sellSignal
    alert(f_json("SELL"), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if alManage and tp1Event
    alert(f_json("TP1_HIT"), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if alManage and tp2Event
    alert(f_json("TP2_HIT"), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if alManage and slEvent
    alert(f_json(tp1Done ? "BE_EXIT" : "SL_HIT"), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)

alertcondition(buySignal, "TL BUY Signal", "TL PbD Pro: BUY {{ticker}} @ {{close}}")
alertcondition(sellSignal, "TL SELL Signal", "TL PbD Pro: SELL {{ticker}} @ {{close}}")
alertcondition(buySignal or sellSignal, "TL Any Signal", "TL PbD Pro: signal on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")

// ───────────── TL PANEL — CRT-Scalper-style cockpit (MT5 look) ─────────────────
varip int glint = 0
if barstate.isrealtime
    glint += 1

f_pos() =>
    switch panelPos
        "Middle Left"  => position.middle_left
        "Top Left"     => position.top_left
        "Bottom Left"  => position.bottom_left
        "Top Right"    => position.top_right
        "Middle Right" => position.middle_right
        => position.bottom_right

// pixel monogram "TL" — gold with vertical depth shading + moving glint column
var array<string> LOGO = array.from("XXXX.X..", ".XX..X..", ".XX..X..", ".XX..X..", ".XX..XXX")

f_logoRowCol(int r) =>
    r == 0 ? COL_GOLD2 : r == 1 ? COL_GOLD : r == 2 ? COL_GOLD3 : r == 3 ? COL_GOLD4 : COL_GOLD5

color COL_BTN_YT = color.rgb(150, 26, 34)
color COL_BTN_WA = color.rgb(28, 138, 66)

f_spacer(table t, int r) =>
    table.cell(t, 0, r, "", bgcolor = color.new(COL_BG, 0), text_size = size.tiny)

f_check(table t, int r, string num, string title, string sub, string status, color stCol, string tip) =>
    table.cell(t, 0, r, num, text_color = COL_GOLD, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_halign = text.align_center, tooltip = tip)
    table.cell(t, 1, r, title + "\n" + sub, text_color = COL_TXT, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_halign = text.align_left, tooltip = tip)
    table.cell(t, 6, r, status, text_color = stCol, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_halign = text.align_right, tooltip = tip)

// live estimate of today's forming shape (panel only, last bar)
f_liveShape() =>
    string s = "…"
    if intradayOK and array.size(cHi) > 3 and dayHi > dayLo
        [vols, pocIdx, vaLoIdx, vaHiIdx, total] = f_profile(cHi, cLo, cVo, nBins, dayLo, dayHi, vaPct)
        float pocPos = (dayLo + (pocIdx + 0.5) * (dayHi - dayLo) / nBins - dayLo) / (dayHi - dayLo)
        s := pocPos >= pocUpper ? "P?" : pocPos <= pocLower ? "b?" : "D?"
    s

var table pan = na
if showPanel and barstate.islast
    if na(pan)
        pan := table.new(f_pos(), 8, 30, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), frame_color = COL_CYAN, frame_width = 2, border_color = color.new(COL_CYAN, 88), border_width = 1)
        for r = 0 to 29
            for c = 0 to 7
                table.cell(pan, c, r, "", bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_size = size.tiny)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 5, 6, 5)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 6, 7, 6)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 8, 7, 8)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 9, 7, 9)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 10, 7, 10)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 11, 3, 11)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 4, 11, 7, 11)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 12, 3, 12)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 4, 12, 7, 12)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 13, 7, 13)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 14, 7, 14)
        for r = 15 to 20
            table.merge_cells(pan, 1, r, 5, r)
            table.merge_cells(pan, 6, r, 7, r)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 21, 7, 21)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 22, 7, 22)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 23, 7, 23)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 24, 7, 24)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 25, 7, 25)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 26, 7, 26)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 27, 7, 27)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 28, 7, 28)
        table.merge_cells(pan, 0, 29, 7, 29)
    int gcol = glint % 8
    // ── rows 0-4: 3D pixel logo ──
    if showLogo
        for r = 0 to 4
            string pat = array.get(LOGO, r)
            for c = 0 to 7
                bool filled = str.substring(pat, c, c + 1) == "X"
                color cellCol = not filled ? color.new(COL_PANEL, 0) : c == gcol ? COL_GLINT : f_logoRowCol(r)
                table.cell(pan, c, r, "  ", bgcolor = cellCol, text_size = size.tiny, text_font_family = font.family_monospace)
    else
        for r = 0 to 4
            for c = 0 to 7
                table.cell(pan, c, r, "", bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_size = size.tiny)
    // ── header ──
    table.cell(pan, 0, 5, "TRADERLIFESTYLE", text_color = COL_GOLD, text_size = size.normal, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_halign = text.align_left, text_font_family = font.family_monospace, tooltip = "TL PbD Shape Pro — trader.lifestyle\nThe PbD method: every day's volume profile prints a letter\n(P / b / D) and that letter sets the next session's playbook.")
    table.cell(pan, 7, 5, glint % 2 == 0 ? "●" : "○", text_color = COL_CYAN, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_halign = text.align_right, tooltip = "Live-tick heartbeat — blinks while the market streams.\n(Pine only executes on ticks, so it pauses when the market is closed.)")
    table.cell(pan, 0, 6, "PbD SHAPE PRO - trader.lifestyle", text_color = COL_CYAN, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_halign = text.align_left, tooltip = "Automates the full P/b/D volume-profile method:\nprofiles, letters, levels, signals and webhook JSON.")
    // ── row 7: animated bull chevrons ──
    for c = 0 to 7
        table.cell(pan, c, 7, "▲", text_color = c == gcol ? COL_GOLD : color.new(COL_BULL, 35), text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_halign = text.align_center, tooltip = "The gold chevron sweeps on live ticks — market open indicator.")
    f_spacer(pan, 8)
    // ── row 9: previous-day shape chip ──
    string chipTxt = na(pdShape) ? "FIRST DAY — COLLECTING" : "PREV DAY:  " + pdShape + "-SHAPE"
    color chipCol = na(pdShape) ? COL_GREY : f_shapeColor(pdShape)
    table.cell(pan, 0, 9, chipTxt, text_color = chipCol, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL2, 0), text_halign = text.align_center, text_font_family = font.family_monospace, tooltip = na(pdShape) ? "The engine needs one FULL day of intraday bars before\nit can classify the first letter. Letters start on day two." : f_shapeTip(pdShape))
    f_spacer(pan, 10)
    // ── rows 11-12: info grid ──
    table.cell(pan, 0, 11, "PROFILE\n" + str.tostring(nBins) + " rows · VA " + str.tostring(vaPct, "#") + "%", text_color = COL_CYAN, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL2, 0), text_halign = text.align_left, tooltip = "Profile engine settings:\neach day's volume is split into " + str.tostring(nBins) + " price rows;\nthe VALUE AREA holds " + str.tostring(vaPct, "#") + "% of the day's volume around the POC.")
    table.cell(pan, 4, 11, "TODAY (LIVE)\nforming: " + f_liveShape(), text_color = COL_CYAN, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL2, 0), text_halign = text.align_left, tooltip = "Live guess of the letter TODAY is printing right now,\nbased on where the POC sits so far.\n'?' because it only becomes official at day close.")
    table.cell(pan, 0, 12, "PD LEVELS\nPOC " + (na(pdPOC) ? "—" : str.tostring(pdPOC, format.mintick)), text_color = COL_GOLD, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL2, 0), text_halign = text.align_left, tooltip = "Yesterday's key levels (drawn as dashed rails on the chart):\nVAH " + (na(pdVAH) ? "—" : str.tostring(pdVAH, format.mintick)) + "\nPOC " + (na(pdPOC) ? "—" : str.tostring(pdPOC, format.mintick)) + "\nVAL " + (na(pdVAL) ? "—" : str.tostring(pdVAL, format.mintick)) + "\nEvery setup triggers off these lines.")
    table.cell(pan, 4, 12, "SHAPE STATS\nP:" + str.tostring(pCnt) + "  b:" + str.tostring(bCnt) + "  D:" + str.tostring(dCnt), text_color = COL_GOLD, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL2, 0), text_halign = text.align_left, tooltip = "How many P / b / D days this chart has printed —\nthe market's personality. Lots of D = range instrument,\nlots of P/b = trending instrument.")
    f_spacer(pan, 13)
    // ── checklist (the video rules) ──
    table.cell(pan, 0, 14, "PbD CHECKLIST (VIDEO RULES)", text_color = COL_CYAN, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_halign = text.align_left, tooltip = "The 6 steps of the method — read top to bottom at every day open.\nHover each row for its rule.")
    f_check(pan, 15, "❶", "PREV DAY LETTER", na(pdShape) ? "waiting for first day close" : pdShape == "P" ? "P = buyers control" : pdShape == "b" ? "b = sellers control" : "D = balance, fair price", na(pdShape) ? "‥" : pdShape, na(pdShape) ? COL_GREY : f_shapeColor(pdShape), "STEP 1 — Yesterday's letter decides today's playbook:\nP = buyers control -> long dips\nb = sellers control -> short rallies\nD = balance -> fade the edges")
    f_check(pan, 16, "❷", "OPEN LOCATION", "vs previous value area", openLoc, openLoc == "INSIDE" ? COL_BULL : openLoc == "—" ? COL_GREY : COL_GOLD, "STEP 2 — Where did today OPEN relative to yesterday's value area?\nINSIDE = playbook fully valid (a D-day needs this!).\nABOVE/BELOW = extra caution, continuation may already be running.")
    f_check(pan, 17, "❸", "DAY BIAS", biasTxt, na(pdShape) ? "‥" : "OK", na(pdShape) ? COL_GREY : COL_BULL, "STEP 3 — The plan for today, derived from letter + open location.\nShapes give a BIAS, not a guarantee — both plans stay written down.")
    f_check(pan, 18, "❹", "ACCEPTANCE WATCH", aboveCnt > 0 ? str.tostring(aboveCnt) + "/" + str.tostring(acceptBars) + " closes above VAH" : belowCnt > 0 ? str.tostring(belowCnt) + "/" + str.tostring(acceptBars) + " closes below VAL" : "holding inside/at value", aboveCnt >= acceptBars or belowCnt >= acceptBars ? "BREAK" : "OK", aboveCnt >= acceptBars or belowCnt >= acceptBars ? COL_PINK : COL_BULL, "STEP 4 — Acceptance = " + str.tostring(acceptBars) + "+ consecutive CLOSES beyond VAH/VAL.\nA wick alone is NOT acceptance (video rule!).\nBREAK = the shape failed -> the full-traverse plan activates.")
    f_check(pan, 19, "❺", "SETUP", contFired or failFired or vahFades + valFades > 0 ? "fired today: " + (contFired ? "CONT " : "") + (failFired ? "FAIL " : "") + (vahFades + valFades > 0 ? "FADE" : "") : "scanning for entry", tradeDir != 0 ? "OK" : "‥", tradeDir != 0 ? COL_BULL : COL_GREY, "STEP 5 — Which setup fired today:\nCONT = Plan A continuation (dip/rally held, ~80%)\nFAIL = Plan B failure traverse to origin (~50%)\nFADE = D-day edge rejection towards POC")
    f_check(pan, 20, "❻", "MANAGEMENT", "TP1 -> BE · TP2 runner", tradeDir != 0 ? (tp1Done ? "BE✔" : "RUN") : "—", tradeDir != 0 ? (tp1Done ? COL_CYAN : COL_GOLD) : COL_GREY, "STEP 6 — Trade management:\nTP1 hit -> stop jumps to break-even, half the job is done.\nThe runner aims for TP2 (full playbook move). Risk-free from there.")
    f_spacer(pan, 21)
    // ── position box ──
    string posTxt = tradeDir == 0 ? "NO POSITION   — —" : (tradeDir == 1 ? "LONG " : "SHORT ") + str.tostring(tEntry, format.mintick) + " · SL " + str.tostring(tSL, format.mintick) + " · TP " + str.tostring(tTP2, format.mintick)
    table.cell(pan, 0, 22, posTxt, text_color = tradeDir == 0 ? COL_GREY : tradeDir == 1 ? COL_BULL : COL_PINK, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL2, 0), text_halign = text.align_center, text_font_family = font.family_monospace, tooltip = "The indicator's virtual position (for signal tracking + webhook).\nEntry · current stop · final target.\nNO POSITION = the engine is scanning.")
    // ── big signal row ──
    color bigCol = str.contains(sigTxt, "TP2 HIT") ? COL_BULL : str.contains(sigTxt, "SL HIT") ? COL_BEAR : tradeDir != 0 ? COL_GOLD : COL_GREY
    table.cell(pan, 0, 23, sigTxt, text_color = bigCol, text_size = size.large, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL2, 0), text_halign = text.align_center, text_font_family = font.family_monospace, tooltip = "Latest signal / trade status.\nGold = trade running · Mint = TP2 hit · Red = stop hit.\nThe setup name tells you which playbook fired.")
    table.cell(pan, 0, 24, str.tostring(pCnt + bCnt + dCnt) + " DAYS CLASSIFIED · FADES " + str.tostring(vahFades + valFades) + "/" + str.tostring(maxFades * 2), text_color = color.new(COL_GREY, 20), text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_halign = text.align_center, tooltip = "Days classified on this chart so far · D-day fades used today\n(the video: the FIRST touch gives the best response,\nso fades per edge are limited to " + str.tostring(maxFades) + ").")
    f_spacer(pan, 25)
    // ── buttons (links shown in tooltip — TradingView tables are not clickable) ──
    table.cell(pan, 0, 26, "▶  YOUTUBE CHANNEL", text_color = COL_TXT, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(COL_BTN_YT, 0), text_halign = text.align_center, tooltip = urlYT)
    table.cell(pan, 0, 27, "Ⓡ  OPEN ROBOFOREX ACCOUNT", text_color = COL_BG, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(COL_GOLD, 0), text_halign = text.align_center, tooltip = urlRF)
    table.cell(pan, 0, 28, "✆  WHATSAPP SUPPORT", text_color = COL_TXT, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = color.new(COL_BTN_WA, 0), text_halign = text.align_center, tooltip = urlWA)
    table.cell(pan, 0, 29, (glint % 2 == 0 ? "●" : "○") + " LIVE · webhook JSON ready", text_color = color.new(COL_BULL, 25), text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = color.new(COL_PANEL, 0), text_halign = text.align_center, tooltip = "Automation: create ONE alert with condition\n'Any alert() function call' and paste your webhook URL.\nEvery BUY/SELL/TP1/TP2/SL/BE event posts ready-to-use JSON:\nid, symbol, action, setup, shape, entry, sl, tp1, tp2, tf, time.")
